# AI agent modes and the harness > Review mode
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L320
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

run::a Run the review mode ::e --> review mode ::c, writes a review pack only ::c

summ::a Summarise the change ::e
  --> diff::a Prepare the diff ::e
  --> confirm::a Confirm the validation result ::e
  --> approve::a Human confirms ::e
summ, diff, confirm, approve --::P--> run

agent::a coding agent --> summ, diff, confirm
wt::a design worktree --> summ, diff, confirm
tests::a repo tests --> confirm
pack::a review pack document --> summ, diff, confirm, approve
you::a User --> approve

agent --> AI agent ::c
wt --> design workspace ::c
tests --> test suite ::c
pack --> review pack ::c, output ::c
you --> Reviewer ::c
